00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:31.725 size:53% position:73% line:53%
CHRISTINE BLACK, candidate

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:32.959 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Montréal-Nord, Ensemble Montréal

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:34.160 size:53% position:73% line:53%
