00:02:08.662 --> 00:02:16.036 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- J'habite toujours André-Jobin.

00:02:09.863 --> 00:02:17.270 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- André-Jobin.

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:18.471 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le quartier de Denis Coderre.

00:02:16.336 --> 00:02:19.706 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ah, bien oui, bien oui!

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.907 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est mon ami, Denis Coderre,

00:02:18.772 --> 00:02:22.142 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est mon ami!

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:23.343 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Oui, bien là, il faut aller

00:02:22.042 --> 00:02:24.578 size:53% position:73% line:53%
