00:02:22.442 --> 00:02:25.779 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Bien oui, bien oui!

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:27.013 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Non, moi, je trouve que

00:02:24.878 --> 00:02:28.248 size:53% position:73% line:53%
