00:02:27.314 --> 00:02:30.684 size:53% position:73% line:53%
là, mais...

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:31.918 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Will Prosper est le principal

00:02:29.783 --> 00:02:33.119 size:53% position:73% line:53%
