00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:36.823 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Documentariste et militant

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:38.024 size:53% position:73% line:53%
antiraciste, il a grandi dans

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:39.259 size:53% position:73% line:53%
