00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:45.365 size:53% position:73% line:53%
WILL PROSPER, candidat, mairie

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:47.334 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Montréal-Nord, Projet Montréal

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:48.535 size:53% position:73% line:53%
