00:02:54.975 --> 00:02:58.345 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Est-ce que vous connaissez

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:59.546 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Will Prosper?

00:02:57.410 --> 00:03:00.780 size:53% position:73% line:53%
