00:03:14.494 --> 00:03:17.864 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Enfin, quelqu'un qui connaît

00:03:15.729 --> 00:03:19.099 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Montréal-Nord!

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:20.300 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Alors qu'il travaillait

00:03:18.164 --> 00:03:21.534 size:53% position:73% line:53%
