00:03:37.684 --> 00:03:41.054 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On croit beaucoup

00:03:38.918 --> 00:03:42.255 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à la deuxième chance.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:43.490 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le milieu socio-communautaire

00:03:41.354 --> 00:03:44.724 size:53% position:73% line:53%
