00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:45.959 size:53% position:73% line:53%
lui avoir pardonné, mais

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:47.160 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sans prendre parti dans

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:48.394 size:53% position:73% line:53%
