00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:49.596 size:53% position:73% line:53%
BRUNILDA REYES, dg

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:50.830 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Les fourchettes de l'espoir

00:03:48.695 --> 00:03:52.032 size:53% position:73% line:53%
