00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:58.171 size:53% position:73% line:53%
OUSSEYNOU NDIAYE, dg

00:03:56.036 --> 00:04:01.174 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Un itinéraire pour tous

00:03:57.237 --> 00:04:02.375 size:53% position:73% line:53%
