00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:04.811 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Donc les deux, à mon avis,

00:04:02.676 --> 00:04:06.012 size:53% position:73% line:53%
j'ai de la difficulté à

00:04:03.877 --> 00:04:07.247 size:53% position:73% line:53%
