00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:23.129 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qu'on ne voit jamais, hein?

00:04:20.994 --> 00:04:24.330 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Montréal-Nord a mauvaise presse

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:25.565 size:53% position:73% line:53%
